                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>وَإِذَ اسَمِعُوْا مَآ أُنْزِلَ إِلَيْ الْرَّسُوْلِ تَرَيْ أَعْيُنَهُمْ تَفِيْضُ مِنَ الْدَّمْعِ مِمَّا عَرَفُوْا مِنَ الْحَقِّ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#16r">-16r</locus>وَنُقَلِّبُ أَفْئِدَتَهُمْ وَأَبْصَارَهُمْ كَمَا لَمْ يُوْمِنُوْا بِهِ أَوَّلَ مَرَّهٍ وَنَذَرُهُمْ فِىْ طُغْيَانِهِمْ يَعْمَهُوْنَ</explicit>
                     <note>First words of the ǧuzʾ, name of surat al-Anʿām, tawḥīd formulas (f.15v), tatimma rubricated. Ihmāl marks (kāf). Some words left incomplete, rewritten in full on the following line. Few words completed on the following line. Deletion (f.4v). Catchwords, some partly cut off, some covered by repair paper.</note>
